sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer / Engineer
    participant UI as ForgeCloud Dashboard (React)
    participant API as FastAPI Control Plane
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database
    participant Git as GitHub Repository
    participant GHA as GitHub Actions CI
    participant ECR as Amazon ECR
    participant Argo as Argo CD Controller
    participant EKS as Amazon EKS Cluster
    participant Obs as Observability (Prometheus/CW)

    Dev->>UI: Trigger Deployment (app_id, version, env)
    UI->>API: POST /api/applications/{id}/deploy
    API->>DB: Record Deployment (status: PENDING)
    API->>DB: Log Deployment Event ("Deployment triggered")
    API->>Git: Commit updated deployment target / trigger CI
    API->>DB: Update Deployment (status: BUILDING)
    API-->>UI: Return Deployment ID & Initial Status

    Note over Git,GHA: Continuous Integration Stage
    Git->>GHA: Trigger CI Pipeline (Push/Dispatch)
    GHA->>GHA: Run Unit & Lint Tests
    alt Tests Fail
        GHA-->>Git: Report CI Failure
        API->>DB: Update Deployment (status: FAILED)
        API->>DB: Log Deployment Event ("Tests failed")
    else Tests Pass
        GHA->>GHA: Build Docker Image
        GHA->>ECR: Authenticate & Push Tagged Image (git-SHA)
        GHA->>Git: Update K8s Manifest / Helm Image Tag
    end

    Note over Git,Argo: Continuous Delivery / GitOps Stage
    Argo->>Git: Poll / Webhook detects manifest change
    Argo->>Argo: Compare Live State vs Desired Git State
    API->>DB: Update Deployment (status: DEPLOYING)

    Argo->>EKS: Apply Deployment Manifest (Sync)
    EKS->>ECR: Pull Container Image
    EKS->>EKS: Create New Application Pods (RollingUpdate)
    
    loop Health Checks
        EKS->>EKS: Execute Readiness & Liveness Probes
    end

    alt Probes Pass (Healthy)
        EKS->>EKS: Route Service Traffic to New Pods
        EKS->>EKS: Terminate Old Pods
        Argo-->>API: Sync Succeeded (Healthy)
        API->>DB: Update Deployment (status: RUNNING)
        API->>DB: Log Deployment Event ("Deployment successful")
    else Probes Fail or CrashLoopBackOff (Unhealthy)
        Argo-->>API: Sync Degraded / Health Check Failed
        API->>DB: Update Deployment (status: FAILED)
        API->>DB: Log Deployment Event ("Deployment failed health checks")
        opt Rollback Execution
            Dev->>UI: Trigger Rollback
            UI->>API: POST /api/applications/{id}/rollback
            API->>Git: Revert Manifest to Last Known-Good Version
            Argo->>EKS: Sync Previous Manifest
            API->>DB: Update Deployment (status: ROLLED_BACK)
            API->>DB: Log Deployment Event ("Rollback complete")
        end
    end

    Obs->>EKS: Scrape Metrics & Collect Logs
    API->>Obs: Query Deployment Metrics & Logs
    API-->>UI: Real-time Status, Logs & Latency / Replicas
